This licence is inherited, not chosen. Parts of this work adapt the UK
Home Office and DWP/HMRC accessibility posters, which are published under
CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. The ShareAlike term requires derivatives to carry the
same licence. See ATTRIBUTION.md for details.

