DISCLAIMER
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This material is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. It is
guidance, not legal advice, and it is not a certification of compliance
with WCAG, the European Accessibility Act, the ADA, Section 508, or any
other standard or law. Following it does not guarantee conformance, and
it does not replace testing with disabled and neurodivergent people.
